Subject: [PATCH] Enforce affiliate buy-cost from the assigned pricing tier.

Designer, cart, catalog, orders, and CRM plan totals use the shared tier resolver. Unassigned affiliates keep the platform markup. Flooring and appliances use the 40/60 markup split. Affiliate storefront prices stay the customer price for every viewer, including an approved contractor resolved by resolvePricingFor.
